opencode2.text:
I've implemented #45 in the currect branch in this folder. A reviewer found the following:

1. Fix CodingRange in include/tiffcraft/TiffExporter.hpp
In convertYCbCrToRgb_, find:
const int32_t cb = refBlackWhite.map<1, 128.0f>(i8);
const int32_t cr = refBlackWhite.map<2, 128.0f>(i8);
Change to:
const int32_t cb = refBlackWhite.map<1, 127.0f>(i8);
const int32_t cr = refBlackWhite.map<2, 127.0f>(i8);
2. Add YCbCr tag names to include/tiffcraft/TiffStdOut.hpp
In toString(Tag tag), before default: /* unknown tag */ break;, add:
case TiffCraft::Tag::YCbCrCoefficients: return "YCbCrCoefficients";
case TiffCraft::Tag::YCbCrSubSampling: return "YCbCrSubSampling";
case TiffCraft::Tag::YCbCrPositioning: return "YCbCrPositioning";
case TiffCraft::Tag::ReferenceBlackWhite: return "ReferenceBlackWhite"; 

make those changes exactly as described

